{"cues":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":64.08},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":64.96,"end":122.24},{"sectionId":"practice","start":123.56,"end":177.573},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":177.707,"end":228.24}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"intro","start":0,"end":0.72,"text":"歡迎回來。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":1.12,"end":4.573,"text":"這一章我們要親手修改個人首頁的主標題。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":4.64,"end":8.32,"text":"上一章知道 HTML 負責內容，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":8.48,"end":14.72,"text":"現在我們再多問一步：瀏覽器怎麼知道哪一段是標題，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":15.04,"end":16.32,"text":"哪一段是介紹？"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":17.04,"end":18.92,"text":"答案就在標籤。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":19.36,"end":21.52,"text":"h1 表示這一頁的主要標題，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":21.68,"end":23.8,"text":"p 用來放段落，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":24,"end":27.36,"text":"button 則建立按鈕。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":27.8,"end":32.68,"text":"大部分這類元素會有開始標籤和結束標籤，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":32.96,"end":34.4,"text":"內容放在中間。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":34.76,"end":39.04,"text":"你可以把這一對標籤想成對內容角色的標記；"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":39.68,"end":41.44,"text":"即使你把文字改掉，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":41.52,"end":43.12,"text":"角色依然保留。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":44,"end":46.32,"text":"先依序查看這三個元素，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":46.8,"end":53.52,"text":"想想個人首頁的名字、介紹和操作入口分別應該放在哪裡。"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":54.4,"end":57.36,"text":"這一章的實作會專注修改標題，"},{"sectionId":"intro","start":57.76,"end":64.08,"text":"讓你先把「找到內容、修改、儲存、確認」這個流程走通。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":64.96,"end":66.32,"text":"請先看老師操作。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":66.84,"end":71.2,"text":"在教學 Terminal 輸入 edit index."},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":71.424,"end":72.32,"text":"html，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":72.8,"end":74.24,"text":"開啟網頁檔案。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":74.72,"end":79.6,"text":"我們找到 h1 標籤中間的「我的第一個網站」，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":80.32,"end":83.76,"text":"把這段文字改成 Hello Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":84.64,"end":85.12,"text":"注意，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":85.32,"end":86.8,"text":"我們只修改內容，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":87,"end":89.72,"text":"不刪掉左右兩側的標籤，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":89.86,"end":91.84,"text":"也不去更動其他段落。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":92.8,"end":97.36,"text":"接著觀察網站預覽：主標題已經換了，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":97.6,"end":101.04,"text":"但原本的樣式和按鈕仍然保留。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":101.76,"end":107.28,"text":"這說明瀏覽器會根據新的 HTML 內容更新畫面。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":108.24,"end":110.72,"text":"示範是在獨立副本上操作，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":111.2,"end":114.48,"text":"等一下你還需要在自己的檔案裡完成。"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":115.28,"end":116.24,"text":"看完後，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":116.32,"end":120.56,"text":"請先確認你能指出要修改的是哪一段文字，"},{"sectionId":"demonstration","start":120.88,"end":122.24,"text":"再進入練習。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":123.56,"end":124.56,"text":"現在換你做。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":125.12,"end":126.4,"text":"開啟 index."},{"sectionId":"practice","start":126.64,"end":127.6,"text":"html，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":128.08,"end":129.36,"text":"找到主標題，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":129.72,"end":134,"text":"把標籤中間的文字改成 Hello Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":134.96,"end":137.2,"text":"這次先使用相同文字，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":137.6,"end":141.92,"text":"讓系統能檢查你是否完成指定步驟。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":142.4,"end":144.56,"text":"修改後先看預覽，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":144.72,"end":146,"text":"再儲存檔案，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":146.56,"end":148.96,"text":"按下「驗證我的練習」。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":149.92,"end":151.2,"text":"如果沒有通過，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":151.52,"end":155.76,"text":"先檢查是不是改到了段落而不是主標題，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":156.24,"end":158.8,"text":"再檢查拼字與空格，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":159.093,"end":161.68,"text":"以及修改是否已保存。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":162.56,"end":164.8,"text":"不要一次修改很多地方，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":165.2,"end":167.2,"text":"先讓這個小步驟成功，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":167.52,"end":169.44,"text":"會更容易找出原因。"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":170.32,"end":172.88,"text":"這頁播放結束就會停下來，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":173.28,"end":175.2,"text":"請放心慢慢操作，"},{"sectionId":"practice","start":175.68,"end":177.573,"text":"完成後再往下一頁走。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":177.707,"end":179.56,"text":"我們一起檢查成果。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":179.84,"end":185.84,"text":"主標題現在應該顯示 Hello Methelia。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":186.64,"end":190.16,"text":"再看看按鈕的顏色和原本的版面，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":190.64,"end":195.04,"text":"這些不應該因為換了標題文字就跟著改變。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":195.48,"end":199.6,"text":"你剛才完成的是 HTML 的內容修改，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":199.92,"end":202.56,"text":"不是重新設計整個網頁。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":203.36,"end":209.52,"text":"請試著用自己的話說明：標籤負責標記內容的角色，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":210.16,"end":214.72,"text":"標籤中間的文字則是實際顯示的內容。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":215.52,"end":216.96,"text":"能解釋這一點，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":217.12,"end":220.4,"text":"就比只記住修改位置更有用。"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":221.52,"end":224.32,"text":"下一章我們保留目前的內容，"},{"sectionId":"reflect","start":224.64,"end":228.24,"text":"改用 CSS 調整按鈕的外觀。"}]}